pytest-cache-files-*/

# Top-level paper-figure scratch scripts -- internal, not the package
# (mousedb/figures/ is the shipped subpackage; this only excludes the repo-root folder)
/figures/

# Internal analysis design docs / scratch notes -- kept outside the repo
KinematicFeatureDecompositionAnalys.md

# Imported reference (an external historical analysis project) -- kept local
# only as a reading reference for kinematic PCA conventions
mousedb/historical_kinematic_analysis/

# Agent/personal notes -- never published.
.notes/

# Accessory/analysis leftovers that must never reach this public repo.
# endpoint_ck_analysis was removed from the tool repo as an accessory, but a
# local copy of it can hold a copy of the database and cached parquet of
# animal data. Untracked and unignored, a single `git add -A` would publish
# it. Ignore the whole tree.
mousedb/endpoint_ck_analysis/
endpoint_ck_analysis/
*.db
